    </a>\n                </div>\n    \n                <p className=\"mt-6 text-base text-black\">Already have an account? <a href=\"#\" title=\"\" className=\"text-blue-600 transition-all duration-200 hover700 focus700 hover\">Log in</a></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
